  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\nYou are programming the diagnostic system for a **space lander**. Before descent, the system must print a two-line confirmation message multiple times. The current code is messy and repeats the block three times. Clean up the code by putting the two-line message into a single function.\r\n\r\n* Read the block of repeated code that shows the lander status.\r\n\r\n* Create a function called **`lander_status_check()`** that prints both lines of the status message.\r\n\r\n* Replace the repeated blocks by calling your new function.\r\n\r\n---",
